[81.159208, "o", "    \u001b[2m# Description:       Starts and stops the Mailman3 server, used to\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[2m#                    manage mailing lists, queues, and all client queries\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[2m\u001b[3m... (95 lines hidden, /toggle to show all)\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[2m  is the local unix username.\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[2m\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[2m  - Direct user mails to `/var/mail/<username>`. They will be accessed with `mailbox.mbox(f\"/var/mail/{username}\")`.\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[2m\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[2m  - List owners do not need to approve join/post requests, i.e., set SubscriptionPolicy.open.\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[2m  Users still need to confirm join/leave by replying though.\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[2m\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[2m  - An `/app/eval.py` script is provided to help iterations.'\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[2mtitle: terminal-bench\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[81.159284, "o", "    \u001b[2mversion: 1.0.0\u001b[0m\r\n"]
