[801.384871, "o", "    \u001b[2m    9fca56c3a910@local.edu\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[2m\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[2mBefore GNU Mailman can unsubscribe you, you must first confirm your request.\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[2mYou can do this by simply replying to this message.\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[2m\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[2mOr you should include the following line -- and only the following\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[2mline -- in a message to reading-group-request@local.edu:\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[2m\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[2m    confirm 418926a020801e73e2b9daa30c46ca39ba20e127\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[2m\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[2mN...\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[2mReply to reading-group-confirm+418926a020801e73e2b9daa30c46ca39ba20e127@local.edu from 9fca56c3a910@local.edu for leave\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[2mmembers after leave: ['8321d604b3a0@local.edu', '85d38a1f2894@local.edu', 'aee6eb8e1bd7c942@local.edu', 'b3b6f1006f51@local.edu', 'cab258c1b007@local.edu', 'd6a288244caa@local.edu', 'e7edc8679fa6@local.edu']\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[2mu2 after leave: ['Your confirmation is needed to join the reading-group@local.edu\\n mailing list.', 'Welcome to the \"Reading-group\" mailing list', 'Announcement-1', 'Announcement-2', 'Your confirmation is needed to leave the reading-group@local.edu\\n mailing list.', 'You have been unsubscribed from the Reading-group mailing list']\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[2mALL OK\u001b[0m\r\n"]
